title: "Parallelise statement network processing and bound propagation"
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |
    Parallelises the statement network protocol processing by introducing
    concurrent worker pools for incoming statement handling and submission.
    Shared state is protected by RwLock for concurrent access. Bounds the
    number of statements propagated per cycle (MAX_STATEMENTS_PER_PROPAGATION = 256)
    and limits in-flight peer sends (MAX_PENDING_SENDS = 4096) to prevent
    unbounded work in the main loop. The StatementStore::take_recent_statements
    trait method now accepts a max: usize parameter.

crates:
- name: sc-network-statement
  bump: major
- name: sp-statement-store
  bump: major
- name: sc-statement-store
  bump: patch
